          "body": "This will not wotk @johnthacker. Warning 4100 is disabled and then reeanbled later on the command line\n![obrazek](/uploads/b1af85e9150cb4f135b3d24dc2974a2d/obrazek.png)\n\nOnce /W3 is enabled the warning will still be present\n![obrazek](/uploads/ef1733cddc9c128f2c0d4a8ff5dd1bf6/obrazek.png)",
